# The image build context: source + the operator's embedded deployment
# state.  The all-in-one model BAKES var/ (credentials, env files, the
# database snapshot) and config/ into the image — the operator accepted
# this for a local-only deployment (the image never leaves their machine;
# never push it to a registry).
#
# Still excluded: caches, the design-shot vault, tests, docs, and anything
# that is not runtime cargo.

.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
htmlcov
.coverage

# Node
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
web/.design-shots

# The sqlite sidecars are rebuildable runtime artifacts; the .sqlite3 main
# file IS baked (the build-day snapshot).
var/*.sqlite3-wal
var/*.sqlite3-shm

# Docs and tests are not runtime cargo.
tests/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
